        "text": "Page: Yang Yun-ho. Sentence: Among the films Yang has directed since are \"Libera Me\" (2000), \"Fighter in the Wind\" (2004, for which he received a Best Adapted Screenplay nomination at the 2005 Grand Bell Awards), \"Holiday\" (2006), \"Rainbow Eyes\" (2007), and \"Grand Prix\" (2010).\nPage: Fighter in the Wind. Sentence: Fighter in the Wind (Korean: 바람의 파이터 ) is a 2004 South Korean film.\nPage: Fighter in the Wind. Sentence: It is based on the Japanese book \"Karate Baka Ichidai\" which is a fictionalized account of karate competitor Choi Yeung-Eui (최영의, 崔永宜) who went to Japan after World War II to become a fighter pilot but found a very different path instead.",
